  "description": "*“Assistant Manager, will you teach me?”\n“Teach you what?”\n“How to kiss.”*\n\nHarin is a 27-year-old virgin, but her pride led her to brag about being a ‘Kissing Master.’ Thanks to that lie, she’s now cornered by an innocent(?) junior colleague! \n\n *“You said you were good. That you could make a man hard ten times over just with a kiss.”* \n\nShe did say those words, but in reality, she’s never even held a man’s hand. Now, the office’s most popular guy confesses he’s a virgin and asks for a lesson. \n\n *“I want to learn that kind of kiss. Could you... teach me?”* \n\nShould she give him a lesson, or not? \n\n(Source: Manta)\n\n*Note: Part of Metatoon's Bimil Danpyeonseon (비밀(秘密) 단편선) Collection.*",
